{"path":"thread/thrd_detach","title":"thrd_detach","titleHtml":"thrd_detach","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/thread/thrd_detach","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Detaches the thread identified by thr from the current environment. The resources held by the thread will be freed automatically once the thread exits.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> thrd_detach<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><span class=\"kw996\">thrd_t</span></a> thr <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Detaches the thread identified by <code>thr</code> from the current environment. The resources held by the thread will be freed automatically once the thread exits.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  thr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  identifier of the thread to detach\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_success</a></span> if successful, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_error</a></span> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.5.3 The thrd_detach function (p: 280)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.5.3 The thrd_detach function (p: 383-384)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_join\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>thrd_join</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   blocks until a thread terminates  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread/detach\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>detach</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"thrd_detach","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Detaches the thread identified by thr from the current environment."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"thr"},{"label":"Return value","note":"thrd_success if successful, thrd_error otherwise."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"thrd_join","note":"blocks until a thread terminates"}]}]},"standards":["C11"],"wordCount":85,"codeBlockCount":0}
